--- a table name with a dot
t.dot	3
--- a database name with a dot
t	3
--- a nested Merge table
NOT_IMPLEMENTED
--- parallel replicas do not expand a streaming read
r2	42
--- incremental refresh from a table without persisted block columns
must set enable_block_number_column = 1 and enable_block_offset_column = 1
--- incremental refresh from a ReplacingMergeTree table
uses a merging engine
--- incremental refresh after a table is dropped and created again
before	[1,2]
after	[1,2,100]
next	[1,2,100,200]
